    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trick or Treat Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trick enemies to frighten them and drop their Halloween candy. Collect candy and fire them from your trusty pistol. Apply candy themed status effects on The Grim Reaper\u2019s missions to turn combat to your advantage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Parry With Your  Candy </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot colorful jawbreaker candy before an enemy attack to parry. Follow up with a light attack to deal bonus damage. Candy has never been so deadly!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Light and Heavy Attacks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing your trusty double cleaver in stylized light and heavy attack combos to weaken your foes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform swift dodges and dashes to avoid enemy attacks. Manage your speed and distance from the enemy to land attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trick or Treat Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trick enemies to frighten them and drop their Halloween candy. Collect candy and fire them from your trusty pistol. Apply candy themed status effects on The Grim Reaper\u2019s missions to turn combat to your advantage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Parry With Your  Candy </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot colorful jawbreaker candy before an enemy attack to parry. Follow up with a light attack to deal bonus damage. Candy has never been so deadly!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Light and Heavy Attacks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing your trusty double cleaver in stylized light and heavy attack combos to weaken your foes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform swift dodges and dashes to avoid enemy attacks. Manage your speed and distance from the enemy to land attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
